# ── Edge function secrets (set via `supabase secrets set`, not in this file) ──
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  — auto-provided by Supabase to functions
# CRON_SECRET                — random string; sent by GitHub Actions cron (Phase 5)
# GEMINI_API_KEY             — AI question/riddle generation (Phase 6); free-tier
#                              key from https://aistudio.google.com — without it,
#                              riddles use the offline bank and Archive Scan is off
# GEMINI_MODEL               — optional; defaults to gemini-2.5-flash-lite
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY / VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY / VAPID_SUBJECT — web push (Phase 5)

# ── Life Assistant (life-bot) secrets — `supabase secrets set …` ─────────────
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY        — Claude API key (console.anthropic.com)
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN       — from @BotFather
# TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET  — random string; Telegram echoes it on every webhook
# LIFE_OWNER_USER_ID       — your auth.users id (the one Viking uses)
# LIFE_LINK_CODE           — random string; send `/start <code>` to the bot once
# LIFE_MODEL / LIFE_EFFORT — optional; default claude-opus-5-5 / medium
# CRON_SECRET              — shared with ascend-notify; also used by the life tick
